window.products.push({"id":708024,"name":"sanvalley Heatless Hair Curler, No Heat Curling Headband for More Comfortable Overnight Sleep, Curling Wrap Kit for Long Hair, Curls Waves Fast with E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T6nKWQIlL.jpg","description":"💝 GORGEOUS CURLS WITH UPGRADED MATERIAL: The newest heatless hair curler is manufactured with rubber material inside the silk fabric. In comparison with cotton fillings, the rubber rod has higher resilience and can be reused for a longer duration. It is the ideal styling wand for curling long lasting waves. 💝 PREMIUM, UPGRADED DESIGN: Heatless curling headband features a segmented style different from the common models. The connecting ribbon rests comfortably on the top of the head and relieves pressure, allowing you to sleep comfortably with overnight curls. The curling rod’s smaller diameter creates ¾ to 1 inch classic curls for all hair types and lengths. For extra long hair, simply wrap around the rod several more times to create even curls. 💝 SAFE & INNOVATIVE: Heatless curling wrap kit brings a different way to curl hair beautifully. There is no need for electricity or heat, and it is extremely safe to use and will not harm your hair. It can also lessen frizz and split ends, giving you beautiful healthy curls during day time or overnight. It’s a wonderful gift for your loved ones! 💝 EASY TO USE: Simply use a pintail comb to part hair to two sides. Add styling spray or lightly wet hair. Secure the flat segment on top of the head with complimentary hair clips. Wrap the hair around twisting rods, and secure it with the scrunchie accessory. Wait 4-12 hours depending on your desired style of curls, then unwrap the hair. Finish with styling spray or mousse to enhance your stunning curls! 💝 GUARANTEED SATISFACTION: If you are not happy with your purchase, we are here to help. Please contact us right away and we will make it right for you. You deserve the best shopping experience and the most gorgeous curls. Happy styling!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T6nKWQIlL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sanvalley","source_asin":"B09YWMX52P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YWMX52P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YWMX52P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
