window.products.push({"id":708044,"name":"Della Commercial 1200W 10-Tray Food Dehydrator Nut Durable Fruit Sausage Jerky Dryer, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712szM-vjLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NEW! The long lasting beauty and modern appearance of our stainless steel dehydrators lends a touch of class to your kitchen. The perfect combination of industry leading air-flow mechanics and materials. The 10 Tray 1200W Dehydrator allows you to dry all types of food including fruits, grain, vegetables and meat. It comes with digital LCD display timer and digital thermostat for setting adaptable processing time and temperature to reserve the best flavor of drying food. It works great for both home and commercial use. This new design dehydrator also comes with a door covered to save your energy. Attached LCD Display timer to keep optimal drying time Setting up temperature precisely Horizontal air flow system with 7 inch fan generates consistent drying heat throughout the drying space Digital control panel for easily handling the drying time and temperature Multiple trays so you can keep different foods separated and organized Digital timer provides 15 hours shut off timer Lift up and lift off front door to lock the door firmly when it is working Drying Fan (Mounted in Rear of Unit - Not on the Bottom) Dry all types of food including fruits, vegetables and meat... Dehydrator can be used for: Vegetables (all types) Fruit Leathers (fruit roll ups) Jerky (both beef and game, needs to be lean for best results) Fruits (all types) Yogurt, Cheese, Re-crisping crackers Fish Herbs Raising Breads Specifications: Display Time: LCD Display Set Timer: up to 15 hours Voltage: 120 Volts - 60 Hz Heating Power: 1200 Watt Temperature Control Dial: 95AF-155AF Trays Material: Stainless Steel Height between Each Tray: 1\" Size of Trays: 14-1/4\"(W) x 16\"(L) Certificate: UL Listed Overall Dimension: 20-1/4\"(L) x 17-1/4\"(W) x 16-3/4\"(H).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712szM-vjLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Della","source_asin":"B01A6CZK74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A6CZK74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A6CZK74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
