window.products.push({"id":708047,"name":"Belt Organizer, KDSKSC 4 Pack Acrylic Belt Storage Holder, Detachable Belt Container Clear Display Case for Closet and Drawer Belts Tie Bow Tie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZE4g4JAbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ARC AESTHETIC DESIGN: This is an arc-shaped belt organizer specially designed for belts, which makes it easier to store and take out belts. It can hold most of your belts, matching regular belt widths. CRYSTAL CLEAR ACRYLIC MATERIAL: Our belt holder is made of high-quality acrylic clear material, transparent like crystal, which allows you to see your belt more clearly. It's more powerful than we thought, not as cheap as plastic. MAGNET ADSORPTION FUNCTION: The magnets are built on both sides of the belt rack, which can be used alone or attached together to make it look neater. MULTI FUNCTIONAL BELT CASE: The acrylic organizer can neatly store your belts, ties and bow ties and other products in your closet, container and table. This belt holder can store belts with large buckles. It is larger than other ordinary ones in the market, easy to store the belts without deformation. 100% GUARANTEE: We offer 30 days money back and 1 year quality warranty, please do not hesitate to contact us for any unpleasant shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZE4g4JAbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KDSKSC","source_asin":"B0B9832CKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9832CKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9832CKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708048,"name":"DI ORO Silicone Turner Spatula Set - Kitchen Spatulas for Nonstick Cookware - Flexible & Thin Flippers for Eggs & Pancakes - 600°F Heat-Resistant & BP","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615MueJgGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM DESIGN - We have combined our wildly popular Chef Series Round and Standard Turner Spatulas into a must-have 2-Piece Spatula Set for your kitchen. The innovative ergonomic handle design of each spatula provides superior grip and the pro-grade silicone on each spatula blade is non-stick and is safe for coated and non-stick cookware. A VARIETY OF APPLICATIONS - Whether carefully folding a ham and cheese omelet or sauteing a colorful medley of vegetables, both the Chef Series Round and Standard Turner Spatulas are perfectly sized and constructed to handle a variety of tasks in your kitchen. The Round Spatula is wide to handle pancakes, omelets, and other large foods. The Standard Spatula is the perfect size to handle foods of all shapes and sizes. GIFT GIVING MADE EASY– DI ORO products make wonderful gifts for women and men whether for Christmas, weddings, housewarming parties, birthdays, Mother's and Father's Day, Valentine's Day and any other special occasion on your calendar. The Chef Series 2-Piece Turner Spatula Set will make a wonderful addition to any kitchen and will provide you and your loved ones with kitchen tools that allow you to prepare the meals and desserts you love. HEALTHY COOKING AND HASSLE-FREE CLEANING - Our food grade, BPA Free, and LFGB Certified Non-Stick 600 F Heat-Resistant Silicone allows for safe and healthy cooking while not compromising functionality or performance. Each high-quality spatula in the DI ORO Chef Series 2-Piece Turner Spatula Set is dishwasher safe or can be easily cleaned by hand. OUR PROMISE, OUR FOREVER WARRANTY – At DI ORO we have set the bar with our Forever Warranty and second to none customer service. We will replace any damaged or defective product for free or provide a full refund if you are not satisfied with your purchase. No questions, no hassles, forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615MueJgGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"di Oro Living","source_asin":"B07J21QHWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J21QHWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J21QHWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
