window.products.push({"id":708060,"name":"Fancii LED Lighted Travel Makeup Mirror, Rechargeable with 10x/1x Magnifying & 3 Light Settings - Compact, Portable, Large 5” Wide Hand Mirror for Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v5Iyo27ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Travel Mirror This sleek, modern mirror is small enough to take anywhere, yet powerful enough to allow makeup application without eyeglasses. Inside you'll find a folding two-panel magnifying mirror, clear from edge-to-edge with no distortion. Our 2-sided portable magnifying mirror comes with 1X and 10X magnification. The Right Light for Any Occasion Choose from three different LED color temperatures: soft white (3,500K), neutral white (5,000K) and natural daylight (6,000K). Each light setting can be further customized by the smart touch dimmable feature. Easily dim or brighten each light setting with a simple touch to help you achieve the exact amount of lighting to suit your preference. Large Distortion-Free Mirror The 5-inch wide high quality glass mirror offers an ultra-clear color-correct view, providing you with superior reflectivity and clarity. Beautiful Anywhere, Anytime The perfect companion for any woman. Elegant, stylish, and perfectly sized to fit in your handbag or purse, making this the ideal compact mirror for home or travel use. Accentuate the Positive This LED lighted compact mirror has the right magnification for any task, from tweezing to makeup application to contact lens insertion. It fits perfectly in one hand but also stays open when resting on a table. - 1X normal view offers you a distortion-free image of your whole face. - 10X magnification is great for close up detail work such as applying eye makeup or tweezing Compact Mirror Dimensions - Body: 130mm (5.1\") diameter, 25mm (1\") thick - 1X Mirror: 88 mm (3.0\") diameter - 10X Mirror: 127 mm (5.0\") diameter Worry-Free Warranty At Fancii, we believe in our products. That's why we back them all with an 24-month warranty and provide friendly, easy-to-reach support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v5Iyo27ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fancii","source_asin":"B0B8C42JK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8C42JK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8C42JK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
