window.products.push({"id":708180,"name":"RNK Shops Dots & Zebra Decorative Pillow Case (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i8pldsEKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let our personalized decorative pillow covers (pillow not included) make a bold impact on your room decor. By simply adding them to a couch, bed, or chair you can brighten up a room without much effort. Simply add this pillow case onto one of your old, out of date throw pillows and you have a brand new look!The pillow covers are smooth and have a soft luster finish which really makes our vibrant designs pop. They even have a hidden zipper on the bottom that gives them a crisp, tailored look. They measure at approximately 14\" x 14\", so be sure to measure your pillow before you buy a case. The actual pillow is not included.We have many traditional and modern patterns to choose from. Our range of colors give you endless accent options!! Personalize them with a monogram, initial, or name to make them one of a kind.Get yourself a set of beautiful sheer curtains and even a lampshade to create a flowing coordinated room. Even add a throw blanket of the same design. You'll never want to go back after creating the exact home decor you want. Be sure to check out our Bedroom section to find more home decor items.About the Design====================================Here is a wonderful zebra print with a fun, modern twist. The top of this design features a black and white traditional zebra print. To add color and flair you can pair the zebra pattern with your choice of color and white polka dot pattern on the bottom.A white scalloped circle label edged in black highlights the personalization of your choice. A wide matching color band trimmed in white completes the design. Features:==================================== * Pillow Case Only (Pillow not included) * Smooth with soft luster finish * HIdden zipper closure * Approx: 14\"x14\"Instructions:==================================== * Hang to Dry * Machine wash separately in cold water on delicate cycle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i8pldsEKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B00JXMIH88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JXMIH88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JXMIH88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
