window.products.push({"id":708192,"name":"Vornado 184 Whole Room Air Circulator Tower Fan, 41\", 184-41\", Black & 62 Whole Room Air Circulator Fan with 3 Speeds, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A35fT-wFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Vornado 184 Whole Room Air Circulator Tower Fan, 41\", 184-41\", BlackThe Vornado 184 Whole Room Tower Circulator offers a more effective way to circulate air with V-Flow Circulation. Typical tower fans oscillate due to a limited range of air movement, so you feel the airflow for only seconds at a time. With V-Flow Circulation, a high volume of air is continuously moving throughout the room, creating quiet, comfortable whole room circulation. The Vornado Tower Circulator features uniquely contoured air outlets that create a wide span of constant airflow, without the need for oscillation. A powerful, yet quiet motor produces higher volume of air movement – 500 CFM and pushes air up to 100 feet. The 184 Tower Circulator features a remote control that magnetically cradles at the top of the unit, so the remote is always in reach. . 4 Speed settings allow you to tailor the airflow perfectly for your needs. The 184 includes a 2, 4, or 8 hour timer ensures you run your Tower Circulator in an energy-saving, efficient way. Vornado has eliminated the wobbly base found on oscillating tower fans in favor of a solid and sturdy system that stands the test of time. 41” height. 5 year limited warranty from Vornado. Model is made for 120 Volts only. PowerCord Plug Type- 2-Pin PolarizedIMPORTANT INTERNATIONAL DISCLAIMER: This item is built to meet U.S. voltage requirements and may not function properly when used in conjunction with external devices that alter or convert voltage or frequency of electricity. Improper use or shipping the product outside the U.S. will void all warranties.Vornado 62 Whole Room Air Circulator Fan with 3 Speeds, BlackIMPORTANT INTERNATIONAL DISCLAIMER: This item is built to meet U.S. voltage requirements and may not function properly when used in conjunction with external devices that alter or convert voltage or frequency of electricity. Improper use or shipping the product outside the U.S. will void all warranties. See lessThe 62 is a mainstay in the Vornado family of Air Circulators. Featuring the signature Vornado grill and deep-pitched propeller-like blade, the 62 is able to aerodynamically circulate all the air in the room. The 3-speed control is easy to access and allows for speed selection to meet any circulation need. The base of the 62 provides added stability when operating from the floor or desktop. Use the 62 all year long in the home or office for added comfort and energy savings in every season. Includes Vornado’s 5 Year satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A35fT-wFL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vornado","source_asin":"B08KH9634L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KH9634L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KH9634L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
