window.products.push({"id":708244,"name":"TAIDEA 12\" Inch Diamond Grit Knife Sharpener Honing Rod T0826D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415vEKkHzEL._SL1001_.jpg","description":"Using introduction: 1.Place the plastic tip on the end of the sharpening rod on a solid surface. Apply lightly downward pressure to avoid slipping during use. 2.Place heel of your blade at the top of sharpening rod at preferred 20 degree angle. Sharpen the knife from heel to tip and repeat 2-3 times, then turn to the other side of the knife until blade sharp. General speaking, use it once a week to keep your blade sharp. 3. Clean the knife with water or wiper and dry it after use, Clean the knife sharpener with non-abrasive brush. Caution: 1.keep stable when sharpening. 2. To prevent falling from height when using. 3.Please put the knife sharpener and knife beyond the reach of children to avoid any accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415vEKkHzEL._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAIDEA","source_asin":"B013SBPZNE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013SBPZNE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013SBPZNE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
