window.products.push({"id":708353,"name":"Grand Canyon National Park Rainbow Giclee Art Print Poster from Travel Artwork by Artist Paul A. Lanquist 24\" x 36\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E5TuqepaL._AC_SL1216_.jpg","description":"This work of art was designed by Artist Paul A. Lanquist (PAL), a Pacific Northwest artist who currently lives in central Oregon. Through the years, PAL has gravitated to the work of illustrators from the 20's, 30's, and 40's that use color and design to communicate their ideas in a straightforward way. By combining the nostalgic look and feel of the past with the spectacular scenery of this country, PAL has created destination and travel posters that capture the beauty and life style of these unique areas. Art print posters are from an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. They are professionally printed at our facilities in the United States on the highest quality art paper using premium, long-lasting art inks that generate intense, rich colors that are true to the artist’s vision and original creation. The time and care put into producing your art poster will make it a tremendous addition of your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room wall décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E5TuqepaL._AC_SL1216_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B01MRCF8O8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRCF8O8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRCF8O8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708354,"name":"Ubauba All Season Comforter Twin Size Filled with Feather & Down, White Cotton Comforter, Duvet Insert with 4 Corner Tabs - Twin 68x90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619RpSYRLwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WARM TIPS ADVANCED◆ This feather comforter is vacuum packed, So it's normal that the fabric will wrinkle, and the feather & down filling will need some time to restore its fluffy when you received, patting & low temperature drying would be more helpful. Of course, Any questions, please feel free to contact us at first time, we will resolve the problems for you sincerely. ALL SEASON COMFORTER ◆ 30°F~60°F indoor is perfect according to the general experience, but maybe a little different depend on personal feeling more or less. Made of cotton fabric and 95% feather & 5% down filling. MULTI-WAYS USING ◆ Used as duvet insert or stand-alone quilt. Cotton fabric is breathable and skin-friendly, Feather & down filling is light but keep you warm and comfortable. EXQUISITE SEWING ◆ Double sewing by four sides avoiding feather drilling out. Box-sewing design keeps the filling steady. Four corner taps make the duvet away from bunching or shifting in the cover. EASY TO CARE ◆ Machine washable in cold water, hanging in the sunshine or drying on low temperature. Not suggest to wash frequently for you to use it for many years, just hang it in the ventilated place every certain time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619RpSYRLwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ubauba","source_asin":"B08LYQCBL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LYQCBL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LYQCBL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708355,"name":"Veronese Design Faith by Ruth Thompson Mounted Templar Knight and Lady Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614eqY+lMQL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The fantastical imagination of artist Ruth Thompson brings you a stunning depiction; her version of a Templar Knight in full plate armor and Lady in her red Royal finest mounted on a white warhorse, protected by the same armor as the knight. He dutifully fights for his loyal Order, represented by the Maltese-Cross flag he carries, just the same as he devotedly fights for love. She carries his shield emblazoned with their colorful coat of arms in one hand while the other rests on his shoulder. Their motto, in Latin on the reins, roughly translates to That Love and Loyalty, and may these always reign! This is one impressively detailed statue that no fantasy or medieval art collection should be without!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614eqY+lMQL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veronese Design","source_asin":"B01N32MBVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N32MBVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N32MBVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708356,"name":"Monarch Specialties 7610 Computer Desk, Home Office, Corner, Left, Right Set-up, Storage Drawers, 70\" L, L Shape, Work, Laptop, Metal, Laminate, Walnu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":438.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LV6LwA9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you've dreamt of having a corner office at work, this computer desk might be the next best thing. The extra-large, L-shaped desktop offers plenty of room for monitors, a lamp, and more. The 1.5-inch thick desktop has a special design that makes it appear as if it is floating and allows the tops of the 2 drawer units to be used as additional surfaces. For flexibility, the drawer units [one with 2 small drawers, the other with 1 large drawer for hanging files] are reversible and can be installed on either side according to your preference. Generous space between the drawer units offers room to easily move an office chair from one side of the desktop to the other. This stylish desk will bring a modern look to your home office. The drawer units and desktop are finished in a walnut wood-look laminate that is contrasted by the black finish of the U-shaped metal legs. Additional dimensions: Interior of small drawers: 13.5 inches L x 15.25 inches W x 3 inches H Interior of large drawer: 13.5 inches L x 17.25 inches W x 10.5 inches H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LV6LwA9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monarch Specialties","source_asin":"B08WM29GCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WM29GCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WM29GCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
