window.products.push({"id":708627,"name":"Tlaks Magnetic Curtains - Thermal Insulated Blackout Curtains - No Tools Installation - Designed and Made in U.S.A. Grey 33.5Wx78L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WlLXC7awL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready-made: More than just a blackout curtain liner. Our high-quality fabric easy to wash and 100% blackout. Total Blackout Coverage: Curtains impede 99% of light and UV rays. Energy smart: Our fabric balances room temperature by insulating against summer heat and winter chill. Protect your furniture, floors, and artwork from the ravages of the sun. Good to go: Thread trimmed and wrinkle-free, easily with standard windows, doors and easy installation. Easy to maintain: Magnetic Curtains are machine washable in cold water, tumble low dry. Quick ironing or steam clean when needed. Designed and Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WlLXC7awL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tlaks Magnetic Curtains","source_asin":"B0BFJZ9PRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFJZ9PRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFJZ9PRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708628,"name":"United States Great Seal Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+kJpA9L3L._AC_.jpg","description":"The custom-made, deep blue rug is emblazoned with the original Great Seal of the United States of America. Five feet in diameter, highest-quality construction in exquisitely hand-tufted wool, incorporating multiple pounds of yarn tufts per square inch. The result is as beautiful as it is unusual. A shield with thirteen red and white stripes covers the eagle's breast. The shield is supported solely by the American eagle to denote that Americans should rely on their own virtue. The red and white stripes of the shield represent the states united under and supporting the blue, representing the President and Congress. The color white signifies purity and innocence; red, hardiness and valor; and blue signifies vigilance, perseverance, and justice. Above the eagle's head is a cloud surrounding a blue field containing thirteen stars, which forms a constellation. The constellation denotes that a new country is taking its place among other nations. The American bald eagle holds in his right talon an olive branch which denotes peace. In his sinister talon he holds a bundle of thirteen arrows. The arrows denote war. The first seal had the eagle facing the olive branch, although just before America's entry into World War I the seal was changed so the eagle faced the opposite direction. It was not until 1948 that President Truman shifted the eagle's gaze back to the olive branch as symbolic of a nation \"both on the march and dedicated to peace.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+kJpA9L3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patriotics","source_asin":"B004N6PL8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004N6PL8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004N6PL8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708629,"name":"LNHOMY Artificial Silk Flowers French Fake Beautiful Hydrangea Bunch Bouquet Flower for Home Wedding Decor Pack of 4, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UxPxJWE-S._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Flowers are such joyful and energetic presence.  They are known to make people better and happier and they are sunshine, food and medicine for the soul. Flowers lighten up any setting and bring in a sense of exclusivity to the place. But, there are chances that the flower arrangement you bought could be sitting on your neighbor's table as well. Packed:4 PCS Silk California Artificial Flowers Bouquet as picture show(The vase is NOT included) Tips: Wire wrapped with plastics is used for firmness and angle-adjustable in creating the stems. The hydrangea bouquets are compressed for ease of storage and transportation. They just needed to be fluffed out once you receive them. Please don't worry if you receive the bouquet with some flowers fall off, just plug the flowers by yourself as they can be assembled. As hand-assembled products, the flowers are inspected by workers at each step of the process before wrapped and packed for shipping. The hydrangea is breathtakingly real and must be touched if they are to be distinguished from nature's own. They don't need water, sunlight, fertilizer, or tender care. You can change the color and the feel of a room by artificial flowers which are considered to be a relatively small investment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UxPxJWE-S._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LNHOMY","source_asin":"B07HGVFC15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HGVFC15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HGVFC15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
