window.products.push({"id":708633,"name":"FITHOME Bento Box with Built-In Ice Pack and Fork,1.2L Leakproof & Reusable Lunch Containers for Adults, Salad Lunch Container with 4 Compartment Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uLJVdkcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Keep Food Fresher] Fithome bento box has a detachable and reusable ice pack which keeps food cool for about 5 hours, so you don't take some time to buy an extra freezer ice pack, It would save time and money, owning you just put it into refrigerate for 3 hours before you need to use it. [Separate Compartment Tray]Having a nice layering and compartment design that won't mix food, 4 compartment tray can Separate snacks, salads, fruits, and other food, and having an individual dressing container, Having it can help you to keep your diet plan and lose weight. [Food Grade Material] The material of our bento box is made BPA-free. It is not smell, stain resistant, and will not get moldy, which means our lunch box is harmless to people. Besides, the lunch container is suitable for the microwave and dishwasher, fridge. [5 compartments and nice storage] Our lunch bento box has 5 compartments, so you can put the bread, snack, fruits, salad, meat, etc separately. It is solid food leakproof, so you don't need to worry they will mix up. The dimension of 8.27 x 7.87 x 2.95 inches makes it portable and easy to carry, while it has enough space for food. [Professional Service] If you have any questions or concerns about your order, please contact us without hesitation. We offer 7*24 friendly customer service, and we will try our best to help you out. NOTE: THIS ITEM IS NOT INTENDED FOR USE BY CHILDREN 12 AND UNDER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uLJVdkcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FITHOME","source_asin":"B0B4G4JQ8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4G4JQ8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4G4JQ8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708634,"name":"Polish Pottery Yarn Bowl 6-inch (Spring Flowers)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518h8zwUrfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Yarn Bowl 6-inch Spring Flowers Dimensions: 6\" wide, 6\" long, 3\" high Capacity: 2oz Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518h8zwUrfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B01N9IL2N1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9IL2N1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9IL2N1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
