window.products.push({"id":708671,"name":"Aviya Twin Mattress - 12 Inch Size Hybrid Innerspring Foam Bed in a Box - Premium Cooling 3\" Quilted Pillow Top (Plush)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":599.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8162rsQ+D8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Aviya Mattress pairs a hybrid of 3 different sag-free high density foams, premium quilting and an individually wrapped coil innerspring core system that provides a mattress with a unique blend of plush comfort and much needed support night after night. A luxury hybrid mattress available in 3 firmness options, allowing you to select the perfect balance of comfort and support that suits your sleeping preference.Unlike 100% foam mattresses, this hybrid mattress provides core support using an innerspring system where each individual steel coil is wrapped in its own fabric pocket. Springs provide \"active support\" versus the passive support of foam, literally pushing back to support your body. With 850 coils (Queen size) and a full 8\" spring depth, our innerspring system provides deeper and more substantial support than the lower quality linked spring systems or 2-3\" tall \"micro\" coils found in other innerspring mattresses.Designed for an ideal night's sleep - unlike memory foam mattresses, the Aviya Mattress 'breathes' allowing airflow through the center, keeping you cool. Mattress is wrapped in 3\" of foam making the edges extra strong and the mattress feel larger. Reinforced lumbar support - the foam and innerspring combination give your back and body the support needed to wake rested and refreshed. Mega soft quilted top layer gives mattress a \"hotel feel\" and provides comfort the moment you lay down.Every effort is made to use locally sourced and components - our foams are also Certi-PUR certified which means the mattresses are made without many potentially harmful materials. The Aviya Mattress offers the best night's sleep AND the best value. Our 100 night \"Sleep Perfect\" promise and 10 Year Assurance ensures you'll be sleeping soundly on your purchase (literally)!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8162rsQ+D8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aviya","source_asin":"B077112D7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077112D7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077112D7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
