window.products.push({"id":708743,"name":"Household Essentials Door Hanging Laundry Bag, Washable Canvas Bag with Loop Handle, Holds Two Loads of Laundry, Great for Dorms and Small Spaces, Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aoMcxekQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maximize your space and keep it tidy with this door hanging laundry bag. This bag can hang on a doorknob or hook on the back of a door easily, without impeding use of the door. It hangs on door knobs, hooks, rods and more. Or you could even hang it on the wall! It’s the perfect space-saving solution for dorm rooms, bedrooms, bathrooms, laundry rooms, small apartments and more. The hanging laundry bag’s unique design keeps the mouth of the bag open while it’s on the hanger, encouraging easy access to the bag. The wire hanger keeps the bag open in a sturdy rectangle, encouraging a slim profile so it doesn't take up excess space. The bag is made of high-quality, heavy-duty canvas, and it’s machine washable, so you can keep the bag as fresh and clean as your clothes. The bag holds up to two average-size loads of laundry, or one extra large load. When it’s time for laundry, empty the hamper into another basket, or remove it from the hanger. To remove it, partially unzip the bag to slide it off the hanger and attached rim. Zip the bag back up, and now you have a canvas laundry tote, complete with a woven loop drawstring and handle. Keep the bag zipped up while doing laundry, or unzip it for faster loading or to easily sort items into different loads. Keep clothes and your hamper off the floor with this hanging laundry bag today!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aoMcxekQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B071HG2R9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071HG2R9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071HG2R9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":708744,"name":"Joseph Joseph Square Colander Small, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WypYJgiGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This hugely popular design has been refreshed with the introduction of a non-slip silicone handle and a softer shape. This ergonomic colander has several unique features. Firstly, the single vertical handle ensures it remains upright and stable if placed in a sink and, when held, leaves one hand free for operating the tap. Secondly, its square corners make emptying rinsed food much easier and more precise. Lastly, its vertical drainage holes allow liquids to drain away quickly and efficiently and its square shape makes for efficient storage. Available in 2 sizes and 4 colors. Small measures 6.25 by 6.25 by 3.5 Inch. Medium measures 8.25 by 8.25 by 4.5 Inch. Dishwasher safe. By Joseph Joseph, masters of form and function.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WypYJgiGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joseph Joseph","source_asin":"B00R86DE20","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R86DE20","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R86DE20","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
