window.products.push({"id":708901,"name":"Vremi Vacuum Sealer Machine - Designed for Food Preservation and Sous Vide - Includes Starter Bags and Suction Hose for Jars and Containers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q+1XbtMRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lock the aroma, freshness, and taste of your food with the Vremi vacuum sealer. The perfect sous vide companion with -0.8 bar vacuum power and 3 mm wide sealing strip. Designed to provide a secure, airtight heat seal to keep moisture out and preserve your meat, produce, and leftovers to stay fresh and flavorful up to 5 times longer. Our 100-watt packing machine is a fully automatic vacuum sealing operation. It has soft-touch digital control buttons and LED indicator lights, making it a simple and quick way to create snack packs or ready-made meals. To clean, wipe the outside of the appliance with a damp cloth and clean the vacuum chamber with tissue paper. Make sure that the appliance is thoroughly dry before using again. Features two selectable dry and moist handheld food settings according to your needs. Choose “Dry” mode for solid items and “Moist” mode for storing wet food. It also effectively works on vacuum jars, containers, and even wine stoppers with the use of the suction hose included with the product. (Note: Canister jar sealer and bottle stopper not included) Plan your meals like a pro with this food vacuum packer. By vacuum sealing family-sized or individual portions of your favorite food, you can make extra space in your fridge, freezer and kitchen cabinets. As an added safety feature, this product stops automatically after the sealing process. This electric vacuum sealer is sleek and stain-resistant, and measures 14.2 x 5.9 x 3 inches. It has strong suction power and a modern design that fits on any kitchen countertop. This kitchen gadget also comes with a 3.5 foot long power cord. Package includes 5 pre-cut bags (7.8 x 11.8 inch), 1 bag roll (7.8 x 78 inch) and a suction tube (15.7 inches).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q+1XbtMRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vremi","source_asin":"B086VRKD37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086VRKD37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086VRKD37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
