window.products.push({"id":708961,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Square, Parchment Paper Liners for Air Fryer Cookers Basket, 7.9 Inch Airfryer Filter Paper, Unbleached, Oil-proof, Non-sti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BtoTUszWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO-FUSS AIR FRYING: If you hate scraping food, this is a must to add to your air fryer accessories. No more hassle cleaning all the oil, grill tray and cumbersome basket after each cooking. Air fryer parchment paper keeps your food from sticking in your rack, pan or basket when cooking, steaming or baking. Simply rest the paper liner on the tray and clean-up will be a breeze. HEALTHY AND RELIABLE MATERIAL: These unbleached parchment paper liners are made of food-grade natural wood pulp, totally fluorescent-free. 40gsm thickness makes the liners durable and sturdy, and won’t tear when lifting even after cooking. They withstand temperatures up to 428℉(Note: To prevent the paper liner from burned, please do not heat the air fryer with no food on it!). It can also be used in frying pan, microwave oven, oven and insta-pot. NON-STICK, WATER-OIL PROOF, NON-TOXIC: Both sides of the liners are coated with non-toxic silicone coating, making it a safe choice for your cooking needs. It also makes the liners waterproof and oil-resistant. They will not tear, rip or soak through. The paper doesn't insulate hot air flow like the silicone does. Take one piece and put it in the basket. After use, take it out and discard it, easy and convenient. UNIQUE DESIGN HANDLE: The non-stick disposable air fryer paper is designed with a handle for easy lifting after cooking. It’s more convenient compared with the regular ones while with no additional cost. Comes with the package, you also get one piece of silicone brush (random color) which comes in handy in your daily cooking. WIDE APPLICATION: Perfect for cooking bacon, chicken, seafood, pork, turkey, French fries, chips, vegetables, broccoli, and much more and it has no effect on the taste of your food. This parchment paper are compatible with cosori air fryer, instant vortex air fryer, chefman air fryer and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BtoTUszWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TREES & BREEZE","source_asin":"B09YSW5CS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-708961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YSW5CS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YSW5CS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
